{'symbol': 'LIN', 'date': '2023-03-14 07:15:00', 'title': 'S&P GLOBAL INCLUDES LINDE IN THE SUSTAINABILITY YEARBOOK FOR 20TH CONSECUTIVE YEAR', 'text': "WOKING, UK / ACCESSWIRE / MARCH 14, 2023 / LINDE (NYSE:LIN) ANNOUNCED TODAY IT HAS BEEN INCLUDED IN S&P GLOBAL'S SUSTAINABILITY YEARBOOK 2023, ITS 20TH CONSECUTIVE YEAR OF INCLUSION. THE SUSTAINABILITY YEARBOOK RECOGNIZES THE WORLD'S LEADING COMPANIES FOR SUSTAINABLE BUSINESS PRACTICES."}